<title>FRANCE: Cheuvreux turns buyer on Eridania.</title>
<headline>Cheuvreux turns buyer on Eridania.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers Cheuvreux de Virieu has changed to a buy advice (note 2) from a sell advice (note 3) on Eridania Beghin-Say after the food group's 1996 results, fund managers said.</p>
<p>The broker increased its 1997 earnings per share estimate to 67 francs from 64.30 and lowered its 1998 estimate to 73.90 from 78.70.</p>
<p>At 1300 GMT, Eridania was up 1.76 percent at 924 while the CAC-40 was up 1.28 percent.</p>
